  <title>Pumpkin Boo - boards and parts</title>
  <author>Tikita</author>
  <description>Parts sheet, 10 Oct 2026. ESP32-CAM sockets at C3-C10 / L3-L10 on the cam board; DFPlayer across the Perma-Proto gap in rows H and C (column position movable); USB-C breakout in J22-J27; PH2.0 pigtail solder points on both boards. Other parts loose, nothing wired. Module pin orders are provisional: check against the silkscreen before soldering.</description>
  <width value="300.0" unit="mm"/>
  <height value="200.0" unit="mm"/>
  <gridSpacing value="0.1" unit="in"/>
  <dotSpacing>1</dotSpacing>
